<programme start="20261017103000 +0000" stop="20261017113000 +0000" channel="BBC America - East"><title lang="en">Predator v Prey</title><sub-title lang="en">Lion</sub-title><desc lang="en">A forensic look at how lions hunt much larger prey, like buffalo and elephants, with new perspectives on the way these predators stalk, chase and kill.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><category lang="en">Animals</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p26799718_b_v12_aa.jpg"/></programme>
