<programme start="20261017123000 +0000" stop="20261017133000 +0000" channel="BBC America - East"><title lang="en">Predator v Prey</title><sub-title lang="en">Crocodile</sub-title><desc lang="en">A forensic look at how crocodiles hunt wildebeest and zebra; a new perspective on how these predators use ambush strategies and the element of surprise.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><category lang="en">Animals</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p26799718_b_v12_aa.jpg"/></programme>
