<programme start="20261018064400 +0000" stop="20261018065500 +0000" channel="Cartoonito 🇲🇽"><title lang="es">Hey Fuzzy Yellow</title><sub-title lang="es">World Elevator Hike</sub-title><desc lang="es">Potato y Moon hacen senderismo en las montañas, mientras que Fuzzy Yellow, Bennu y Marzipan notan un pequeño planeta flotando sobre la casa de Marzipan y toman un viaje a este nuevo mundo para explorarlo.</desc><date>20250101</date><category lang="es">Series/Children</category><category lang="es">Series</category><category lang="es">Series/Action</category><category lang="es">Children/Series</category><category lang="es">Culture/Knowledge</category><category lang="es">Children</category><category lang="es">Series/Animated</category><category lang="es">Culture</category><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.37.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E38</episode-num><icon src="https://www.izzigo.tv/images/repository/235/17141235-SNAPSHOT-l.jpg"/></programme>
