<programme start="20261017100000 +0000" stop="20261017110000 +0000" channel="OWN"><title lang="en">Ready to Love</title><sub-title lang="en">Don&apos;t Be Shy in the Chi</sub-title><desc lang="en">Host Thomas Miles is in Chicago to guide successful Black singles in their 30s and 40s through the highs and lows of dating, challenges and emotional conversations as they search for genuine connections, lasting relationships and true love.</desc><category lang="en">Reality TV</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p15955791_b_v12_ap.jpg"/></programme>
