<programme start="20261018094800 +0000" stop="20261018105000 +0000" channel="Stories by AMC"><title lang="es">The Terror</title><sub-title lang="es">Infamy: A Sparrow in a Swallow&apos;s Nest</sub-title><desc lang="es">In 1941, Chester Nakayama is caught between his insular Japanese-American neighborhood on Terminal Island and his current all-American life; extreme circumstances push his community and personal life to the brink, all while someone watches closely.</desc><credits><director>Josef Wladyka</director><actor>Derek Mio</actor><actor>Shingo Usami</actor><actor>Naoko Mori</actor><actor>Cristina Rodlo</actor><actor>Kiki Sukezane</actor><actor>George Takei</actor><actor>Miki Ishikawa</actor><actor>Hira Ambrosino</actor><actor>Eiji Inoue</actor><actor>James Saito</actor><actor>Alex Shimizu</actor><actor>Teach Grant</actor><actor>Reilly Dolman</actor><actor>Lee Shorten</actor></credits><date>20190812</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">1.0.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S02E01</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-14</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/cms/images/ba90e74c44ac1926c1f5bb06deadbbf27c07e586.jpg"/></programme>
