<programme start="20261018123300 +0000" stop="20261018132400 +0000" channel="Stories by AMC"><title lang="es">The Terror</title><sub-title lang="es">Infamy: The Weak Are Meat</sub-title><desc lang="es">Chester, in search of a better life, is treated with hostility by his fellow Americans; Luz hopes to be accepted by Henry and Asako in their new home as the Japanese American community celebrates Obon, a festival to commemorate the dead.</desc><credits><director>Michael Lehmann</director><actor>Derek Mio</actor><actor>Shingo Usami</actor><actor>Naoko Mori</actor><actor>Cristina Rodlo</actor><actor>Kiki Sukezane</actor><actor>George Takei</actor><actor>Miki Ishikawa</actor><actor>Hira Ambrosino</actor><actor>C. Howell</actor><actor>Reed Diamond</actor><actor>Christopher Naoki Lee</actor><actor>Marcus Toji</actor><actor>Lee Shorten</actor><actor>Alex Shimizu</actor></credits><date>20190902</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">1.3.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S02E04</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-14</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/cms/images/f065b84e2bfe0294f1d2cd8691592466b3a1f794.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261018132400 +0000" stop="20261018141600 +0000" channel="Stories by AMC"><title lang="es">The Terror</title><sub-title lang="es">Infamy: Shatter Like a Pearl</sub-title><desc lang="es">The Japanese Americans are forced to undertake a humiliating exercise that divides the community; Chester comes face to face with a man who forces him to question his very nature; Luz, stricken by grief, is forced to make an important choice.</desc><credits><director>Lily Mariye</director><actor>Derek Mio</actor><actor>Shingo Usami</actor><actor>Naoko Mori</actor><actor>Cristina Rodlo</actor><actor>Kiki Sukezane</actor><actor>George Takei</actor><actor>Miki Ishikawa</actor><actor>C. Howell</actor><actor>Reed Diamond</actor><actor>Christopher Naoki Lee</actor><actor>Marcus Toji</actor><actor>Ruben Garfias</actor><actor>Lee Shorten</actor><actor>Lee Macdonald</actor><actor>Kazuya Tanabe</actor></credits><date>20190909</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">1.4.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S02E05</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-14</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/cms/images/ee4c7dcc7dcaf142856f78412cb721837aff8b97.jpg"/></programme>
