<programme start="20261019010000 +0000" stop="20261019020000 +0000" channel="Todo Drama"><title lang="es">El otro lado del paraíso</title><sub-title lang="es">El otro lado del paraíso</sub-title><desc lang="es">Melissa huye con Diego para un viaje de fin de semana y sus padres presentan una denuncia por secuestro. Mariano termina con Sofía.</desc><credits><director>André Binder</director><actor>Bianca Bin</actor><actor>Sergio Guizé</actor><actor>Grazi Massafera</actor><actor>Rafael Cardoso</actor><actor>Marieta Severo</actor><actor>Eriberto Leão</actor><actor>Fernanda Montenegro</actor><actor>Flávio Tolezani</actor><actor>Gloria Pires</actor><actor>Nathalia Timberg</actor><actor>Juliano Cazarré</actor><actor>Lima Duarte</actor><actor>Emílio Mello</actor><actor>Emílio de Mello</actor><actor>Juca de Oliveira</actor><actor>Thiago Fragoso</actor><actor>Bárbara Paz</actor><actor>Érika Januza</actor><actor>Alejandro Claveaux</actor><actor>Caio Paduan</actor><actor>Marcello Novaes</actor><actor>Eliane Giardini</actor><actor>Arthur Aguiar</actor><actor>Mayana Neiva</actor><actor>Laura Cardoso</actor></credits><date>20191211</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.36.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E37</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-G</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/a9e78fa0b1249edf641f8c0e8161a400.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261019020000 +0000" stop="20261019030000 +0000" channel="Todo Drama"><title lang="es">El clon</title><sub-title lang="es">Juntos en un bar</sub-title><desc lang="es">Escobar siente celos al ver a Clarice en un bar con Julio. Para Deusa es demasiado raro que Albieri esté escondiendo a Léo de Edna. Maysa, Lucas y Leonidas concuerdan en dejar de darle dinero a Mel para hacerla regresar a casa.</desc><credits><director>Jayme Monjardim</director><actor>Murilo Benício</actor><actor>Giovanna Antonelli</actor><actor>Letícia Sabatella</actor><actor>Juca de Oliveira</actor><actor>Adriana Lessa</actor><actor>Vera Fischer</actor><actor>Reginaldo Faria</actor><actor>Dalton Vigh</actor><actor>Daniela Escobar</actor><actor>Débora Falabella</actor><actor>Eliane Giardini</actor><actor>Antonio Calloni</actor><actor>Stênio Garcia</actor><actor>Jandira Martini</actor><actor>Neuza Borges</actor><actor>Marcello Novaes</actor><actor>Cristiana Oliveira</actor><actor>Nívea Maria</actor><actor>Solange Couto</actor><actor>Osmar Prado</actor><actor>Cissa Guimarães</actor><actor>Marcos Frota</actor><actor>Sthefany Brito</actor></credits><date>20261012</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.124.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E125</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/337676a63c335916540206ce19b49fbc.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261019030000 +0000" stop="20261019040000 +0000" channel="Todo Drama"><title lang="es">El clon</title><sub-title lang="es">El carnaval de Sao Cristovao</sub-title><desc lang="es">Khadijja intenta todo para que sus padres no se separen. En Sao Cristovao todos festejan el carnaval en la calle. Abdul planea organizar una boda para Mohamed sin avisarle a Latiffa. Yvete planea ir a la cita de Leonidas en lugar de Amália.</desc><credits><director>Jayme Monjardim</director><actor>Murilo Benício</actor><actor>Giovanna Antonelli</actor><actor>Letícia Sabatella</actor><actor>Juca de Oliveira</actor><actor>Adriana Lessa</actor><actor>Vera Fischer</actor><actor>Reginaldo Faria</actor><actor>Dalton Vigh</actor><actor>Daniela Escobar</actor><actor>Débora Falabella</actor><actor>Eliane Giardini</actor><actor>Antonio Calloni</actor><actor>Stênio Garcia</actor><actor>Jandira Martini</actor><actor>Neuza Borges</actor><actor>Marcello Novaes</actor><actor>Cristiana Oliveira</actor><actor>Nívea Maria</actor><actor>Solange Couto</actor><actor>Osmar Prado</actor><actor>Cissa Guimarães</actor><actor>Marcos Frota</actor><actor>Sthefany Brito</actor></credits><date>20261013</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.125.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E126</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/713ac416e64e8028432b49f5d1952205.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261019040000 +0000" stop="20261019050000 +0000" channel="Todo Drama"><title lang="es">El clon</title><sub-title lang="es">Intenciones ocultas</sub-title><desc lang="es">Albieri le dice a Matioli que desea hablar con él. Dalva le cuenta a Lucas el estado en el que vive Mel. Ranya piensa que Jade intenta arruinar su matrimonio. Jade baila para Said a cambio de salir de casa.</desc><credits><director>Jayme Monjardim</director><actor>Murilo Benício</actor><actor>Giovanna Antonelli</actor><actor>Letícia Sabatella</actor><actor>Juca de Oliveira</actor><actor>Adriana Lessa</actor><actor>Vera Fischer</actor><actor>Reginaldo Faria</actor><actor>Dalton Vigh</actor><actor>Daniela Escobar</actor><actor>Débora Falabella</actor><actor>Eliane Giardini</actor><actor>Antonio Calloni</actor><actor>Stênio Garcia</actor><actor>Jandira Martini</actor><actor>Neuza Borges</actor><actor>Marcello Novaes</actor><actor>Cristiana Oliveira</actor><actor>Nívea Maria</actor><actor>Solange Couto</actor><actor>Osmar Prado</actor><actor>Cissa Guimarães</actor><actor>Marcos Frota</actor><actor>Sthefany Brito</actor></credits><date>20261014</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.126.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E127</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/8ed7afb52980b34a34782b5781495057.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261019050000 +0000" stop="20261019060000 +0000" channel="Todo Drama"><title lang="es">El clon</title><sub-title lang="es">Envidia</sub-title><desc lang="es">Jade se sorprende al ver sus maletas listas. Clarice, Lobato y Carol van a una discoteca. Amina cree tener una oportunidad con Mohamed. Deusa le pide a Albieri que hable con Edvaldo. Escobar piensa que Edna tiene envidia de Alicinha.</desc><credits><director>Jayme Monjardim</director><actor>Murilo Benício</actor><actor>Giovanna Antonelli</actor><actor>Letícia Sabatella</actor><actor>Juca de Oliveira</actor><actor>Adriana Lessa</actor><actor>Vera Fischer</actor><actor>Reginaldo Faria</actor><actor>Dalton Vigh</actor><actor>Daniela Escobar</actor><actor>Débora Falabella</actor><actor>Eliane Giardini</actor><actor>Antonio Calloni</actor><actor>Stênio Garcia</actor><actor>Jandira Martini</actor><actor>Neuza Borges</actor><actor>Marcello Novaes</actor><actor>Cristiana Oliveira</actor><actor>Nívea Maria</actor><actor>Solange Couto</actor><actor>Osmar Prado</actor><actor>Cissa Guimarães</actor><actor>Marcos Frota</actor><actor>Sthefany Brito</actor></credits><date>20261015</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.127.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E128</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/d4e9bb7a6a49ecfd3600dd28f997548c.jpeg"/></programme>
